{"title":"Ages 0-3","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"pb3-and-the-vegetables-cd","title":"PB3 and the Vegetables + CD","description":"\u003cp\u003eRare Book\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 210\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jane Cadwallader\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788853604231\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45472787857561,"sku":"7RC9788853604231","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/684ff89b4ca32_PB3_and_the_Vegetables___CD_Jane_Cadwallader.jpg?v=1752084378"},{"product_id":"my-little-pony-early-reader-rainbow-dashs-big-race-book-3","title":"My Little Pony Early Reader: Rainbow Dash's Big Race!: Book 3","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis colour Early Reader is perfect for young pony fans just starting their own reading adventure.Rainbow Dash REALLY wants to win the big Equestira Games relay race. But her team aren't very fast. When she gets the chance to fly with her heroes, the Wonderbolts, Rainbow Dash is torn. She loves her friends . . . but does she love winning more?These full-colour My Little Pony Early Readers are endorsed by a literacy consultant and perfect for building reading ability.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 198 x 131\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Pony\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408344620\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 64\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45575464878233,"sku":"16RA-49781408344620","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686e965ad3d7b_My_Little_Pony_Early_Reader-_Rainbow_Dash_s_Big_Race_-_Book_3_Pony.jpg?v=1752513362"},{"product_id":"rainbow-dash-and-the-daring-do-double-dare","title":"Rainbow Dash and the daring do double dare","description":"\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 0 x 0\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: G.M. Berrow\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408347843\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: \u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45575465107609,"sku":"16RA-49781408347843","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/686e978234c2d_Rainbow_Dash_and_the_daring_do_double_dare_G.M._Berrow.jpg?v=1752513375"},{"product_id":"baby-s-first-book","title":"Baby’s First Book","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"129\" data-end=\"186\"\u003eA beautiful first book to share with your little one.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"491\"\u003e\u003cem data-start=\"188\" data-end=\"207\"\u003eBaby’s First Book\u003c\/em\u003e by Clare Beaton is a delightful introduction to the world of books for babies and toddlers. Featuring soft, hand-stitched felt illustrations, bright colors, and simple text, this book engages little eyes and hands while encouraging early learning and bonding through reading.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"671\"\u003eEach page showcases familiar objects, animals, and everyday scenes—perfect for developing your baby's vocabulary, recognition skills, and love of stories from the very beginning.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"743\"\u003eA keepsake-quality board book that’s as charming as it is educational.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"844\"\u003eAuthor: Clare Beaton\u003cbr data-start=\"769\" data-end=\"772\"\u003eISBN: 9781905236046\u003cbr data-start=\"795\" data-end=\"798\"\u003eFormat: \u003cbr data-start=\"820\" data-end=\"823\"\u003ePages: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45621230272665,"sku":"1RG9098765","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/3165130.jpg?v=1754484997"},{"product_id":"the-lighthouse-keepers-breakfast","title":"The Lighthouse Keeper's Breakfast","description":"\u003cp\u003eMr and Mrs Grinling are throwing a fancy-dress party to celebrate the lighthouse's 200th birthday and everyone is invited. But when the Grinlings take to the high seas, they get more swashbuckling than they bargained for.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 216 x 248\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: David Armitage\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780439979344\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684555546777,"sku":"BLK-1-9780439979344","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68aec645e9b8c_The_Lighthouse_Keeper_s_Breakfast_David_Armitage.jpg?v=1756578040"},{"product_id":"abacus-year-4-textbook-2","title":"Abacus. Year 4 Textbook 2","description":"\u003cp\u003eAbacus Year 4 Textbook 2\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 195 x 265\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jennie Kerwin\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781408278512\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 96\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738314399897,"sku":"15RE-59781408278512","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca5b0198a78_Abacus._Year_4_Textbook_2_Jennie_Kerwin__1.jpg?v=1758563791"},{"product_id":"i-am-peter-peter-rabbit-animation","title":"I Am Peter (Peter Rabbit Animation)","description":"\u003cp\u003eMeet the newly animated Peter Rabbit! Donned in his father's blue coat, Peter is as frisky and adventurous as ever. His mother has given him his father's old journal--full of adventure stories, secret escape routes, and empty pages for Peter to fill in himself. This classic rabbit, along with his best friends, Lily Bobtail and Benjamin Bunny, is ready for another adventure!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 162 x 235\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Frederick Warne\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780141350042\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738316365977,"sku":"15RE-59780141350042","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca621e96fe5_I_Am_Peter__Peter_Rabbit_Animation__Frederick_Warne.jpg?v=1758563851"},{"product_id":"three-read-with-me-stories-early-readers-large-print-reading-scheme","title":"Three Read With Me Stories Early Readers Large Print Reading Scheme","description":"\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 216 x 163\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: \u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780709724384\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Board book\u003cbr\u003e\nPages:\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803722866841,"sku":"17RA-59780709724384","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68efdab3c3f49_Three_Read_With_Me_Stories_Early_Readers_Large_Print_Reading_Scheme.webp?v=1760807374"},{"product_id":"1st-activity-book-environment","title":"1st Activity Book - Environment","description":"\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 203 x 47\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dreamland\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9788184513653\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 68\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45820903260313,"sku":"17RC-59788184513653","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f9f443eb4b0_1st_Activity_Book_-_Environment_Dreamland.jpg?v=1761234412"},{"product_id":"1st-activity-book-good-habit","title":"1st Activity Book - Good Habit","description":"\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 203 x 47\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Dreamland\u003cbr\